  "body": "## Pulse Music v3.2.6 - Discovery Mix Slider, Listening Health & Unified Music Shelf\n\n### ≡ƒÄÜ∩╕Å Discovery Mix Slider\n- **Dynamic Queue Blending**: Choose a precise ratio between familiar tracks and new discovery recommendations (e.g. 80% familiar / 20% new) and adjust in real-time while listening.\n- **Queue Bottom Sheet & Apple Music Queue**: Integrated pastel lavender Material 3 slider with quick presets (80/20, 50/50, 20/80) and live badge percentage.\n- **Continuous Queue Interleaving**: Automated playback continuations balance liked favorites and fresh recommendations seamlessly.\n\n### ≡ƒÄº Listening Health & Hearing Safety\n- **Headphone Listening Time & Volume Exposure**: Real-time tracking of continuous session duration and headphone volume ratio.\n- **Break Reminders**: Configurable break interval dialog (Off, 30m, 45m, 60m, 90m, 120m) sending gentle reminders to give ears a rest.\n- **Safer Volume Limit**: Option to cap headphone output to safe listening levels (75%) with clear safety notifications.\n- **Live Safety Card in Settings**: Displays current session duration, today's listening minutes, and real-time safety status (`Safe`, `Moderate`, `Caution`).\n\n### ≡ƒôÜ Unified Music Shelf\n- **One Searchable Library**: Merges streaming tracks, saved/purchased albums, and local personal audio files into one unified, searchable collection.\n- **Categorical Filtering**: Instant filtering by `All`, `Streaming`, `Albums`, and `Personal Audio`.\n- **Integrated Library Chip**: Embedded directly in the Library header for one-tap access.\n\n### ≡ƒîÉ Music Streaming Language Preference\n- **Localized Streaming**: Select preferred music streaming language in Settings to tailor the home screen feed and recommended songs instantly.\n\n### ≡ƒÅ╖∩╕Å Pulse Music Rebranding\n- **Unified Identity**: Updated desktop and system media control integrations to Pulse Music.\n"
